# Secrets for docker compose; .env.example is the template.
.env

# Sync-conflict copies. iCloud and Dropbox resolve a clash by writing
# "name 2.ext" beside the original. These have broken the Docker build once by
# shadowing a real directory, and a copy of .env would not be matched by the
# rule above — so they are excluded by name here as well.
* 2
* 2.*
# ...and the directory form. Something outside git — iCloud in ~/Documents by
# the look of the 600 permissions — leaves conflict copies in this tree: 41
# duplicate directories under web/src alone, each holding a stale snapshot.
# A file pattern missed «src/app/wrapped 2/page.tsx», which sat in
# tsconfig's include and broke the typecheck with three errors from code
# nobody had edited in a week.
* [0-9]/
* [0-9].*
node_modules/
.superdesign/tmp/
